# Per-installation settings for the Campus Branch console. Copy this file to `.env.local` in the app folder
# (next to package.json) on each computer, fill it in for THAT computer, and restart the app.
# Never copy one branch's .env.local to another, and never put it in a deployment package or chat.
# Next.js reads .env.local when the app starts (both `npm run dev` and `npm run start:lan`).

# The one https address phones use: this computer's own Tailscale name, as shown by `tailscale status`
# or in Settings › "Ready for phones?". A bare origin only: https, no path, no trailing page.
# Leave it unset to let the app read the name from the local Tailscale (only used once Tailscale Serve
# forwards to the app). Unset + no Serve = phones get no address (Settings › "Ready for phones?" says why).
# BRANCH_URL=https://office-pc.your-tailnet.ts.net

# Only if the `tailscale` command is not on PATH for the account that runs the app.
# Windows default:  C:\Program Files\Tailscale\tailscale.exe
# macOS app:        /Applications/Tailscale.app/Contents/MacOS/Tailscale
# TAILSCALE_CLI=
